  // divided the seat fee by tokens observed *so far* while Python divided by a
  // projected full month. On 8 August the denominators were 3.40B here against
  // 4.77B there -- the same session read $1.17 on screen and $0.83 in the
  // terminal, roughly 40% high, every day of every month.
